{
    "title": "Qibla Finder - Qibla Direction",
    "description": "<h1>Qibla Finder - Qibla Direction</h1>\r\n\r\nDiscover a great tool - Qibla finder and quickly find the Qibla using an Android smartphone. It's simple - open the app and make sure to place your phone on a flat surface to find the Qibla with the Qibla Finder. Also, you will see a qibla compass which will show you the qibla direction online. Finding the Qibla and showing you the exact Kaaba direction will take only a few seconds.\r\n\r\n<h2>Find the Qibla Direction Instantly!</h2>\r\n\r\nQibla direction finder app can show you kiblah with accuracy but make sure to calibrate your compass before using it to find the Qibla. Everyone can utilize it to search Qibla online or offline!\r\n\r\n<b>Precise & Fast Qibla Finder Compass, shows 100% accurate Qibla Direction worldwide!</b>\r\n\r\nUseful Qibla Finder app and Tasbeeh Counter feature in one app! The Qibla Finder - Qibla Direction app has 4 themes of Qibla compass! You can customize the Qibla Finder app according to your choice.\r\n\r\nFantastic Features of Qibla Finder - Qibla Direction App:\r\n1- Find the Qibla Direction: Find the Qibla easily with Qibla Compass feature!\r\n2- Tasbeeh Counter: Use the Tasbeeh Counter feature that will allow you to count on 33 or 99 taps tasbeehs.\r\n3- Qibla Compass Themes: Qibla Direction app will allow you to change compass and needle themes according to your choice.\r\n4-Automatic location: The Qibla direction app will automatically fetch your location to find the Qibla accurately. \r\n5- Small size: The Qibla Finder app will take only a few Mb's of your storage and give you the best experience on your phone to find the Qibla.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<h1>Qibla Finder - Qibla Direction</h1><br><br>Discover a great tool - Qibla finder and quickly find the Qibla using an Android smartphone. It&#39;s simple - open the app and make sure to place your phone on a flat surface to find the Qibla with the Qibla Finder. Also, you will see a qibla compass which will show you the qibla direction online. Finding the Qibla and showing you the exact Kaaba direction will take only a few seconds.<br><br><h2>Find the Qibla Direction Instantly!</h2><br><br>Qibla direction finder app can show you kiblah with accuracy but make sure to calibrate your compass before using it to find the Qibla. Everyone can utilize it to search Qibla online or offline!<br><br><b>Precise &amp; Fast Qibla Finder Compass, shows 100% accurate Qibla Direction worldwide!</b><br><br>Useful Qibla Finder app and Tasbeeh Counter feature in one app! The Qibla Finder - Qibla Direction app has 4 themes of Qibla compass! You can customize the Qibla Finder app according to your choice.<br><br>Fantastic Features of Qibla Finder - Qibla Direction App:<br>1- Find the Qibla Direction: Find the Qibla easily with Qibla Compass feature!<br>2- Tasbeeh Counter: Use the Tasbeeh Counter feature that will allow you to count on 33 or 99 taps tasbeehs.<br>3- Qibla Compass Themes: Qibla Direction app will allow you to change compass and needle themes according to your choice.<br>4-Automatic location: The Qibla direction app will automatically fetch your location to find the Qibla accurately. <br>5- Small size: The Qibla Finder app will take only a few Mb&#39;s of your storage and give you the best experience on your phone to find the Qibla.",
